  "sent_to_model": "right need ur help wi a letter tae go in wi the family birthday invites. Morag that owns the salon has said I can have the place to myself the saturday afternoon before grans 80th so I want to do everyones hair for free before we go out for her dinner. Gran doesnt know yet so its just to my mum, my sister Kirsty and my auntie Linda (gran isnt in the chat dont worry lol). Im buzzing about it. need them to know the plan and get back to me wi what they want done so I can order stuff in. dates n that are below\n\n- grans 80th is sun 13 dec. salon is mine sat 12 dec from 1pm, Morag closes at 12 on a sat\n- salon is Hair by Morag on Dumbarton Rd, they all know it\n- me, mum, Kirsty, Linda, gran, plus Kirsty's two wee ones Ava (9) and Ruby (6) = 7 heads\n- dinner booked sat 12 dec 8.30 at the Italian place on Byres Rd, table for 9 inc. uncle Davie and Kirsty's man\n- need to know colours by fri 27 nov so I can order from the wholesaler\n- gran said at easter she'd 'love to go silver properly' but wont pay salon prices\n- last time I did Linda's colour in her kitchen she got dye on the cooker and the dog\n- cut and blowdry for everyone fine, colours only if they tell me in time\n- Ava and Ruby can get wee braids and glitter spray, theyll love it\n- someone needs to get gran there for 1 without telling her why, mum best bet\n- bring a bottle of fizz, Morag says fine as long as we tidy up\n\n(About me: hairdresser who rents a chair in a salon, 35, Glasgow, Scotland. Length: it should come to roughly 250-400 words.)",
